# Invite links carry the code as a path segment (/join/AB3XZ9). Serve the landing page for
# any of them rather than 404ing; the page reads the code out of the URL itself.
# Target must live outside /join/ — Cloudflare Pages silently drops a /join/* -> /join/... rule
# as a self-matching infinite-loop risk (it collapses /join/index.html back to /join/, which
# matches the wildcard again).
/join/*  /join.html  200
